{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2021-05-12 07:00:00', 'title': "MOODY'S AND TEAM8 ANNOUNCE INVESTMENT IN VISIBLERISK AS IT LAUNCHES CYBER RATING", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOODY'S CORPORATION (NYSE:MCO) AND TEAM8, A GLOBAL VENTURE GROUP, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF A $25 MILLION INVESTMENT IN VISIBLERISK, A JOINT VENTURE ESTABLISHED BY THE TWO COMPANIES IN 2019 TO EVALUATE ENTERPRISE CYBER RISK. ADDITIONALLY, VISIBLERISK TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A CYBER RATING PRODUCT, BUILDING ON THE COLLABORATION BETWEEN MOODY'S AND TEAM8 TO DEVELOP A GLOBAL STANDARD FOR ASSESSING CORPORATE CYBER RISK. “MOODY'S INVESTMENT IN VISIBLERISK ALI"}